<title>Netherlands: SLIGRO MAKES SMALL ACQUISITION.</title>
<headline>SLIGRO MAKES SMALL ACQUISITION.</headline>
<dateline>VEGHEL, Netherlands 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sligro Beheer NV said it expected to reach agreement soon on acquisition of the business activities of Horeca Specialiteiten Van der Meer BV.</p>
<p>Sligro said Leiden-based Van der Meer was a wholesale supplier of deep-frozen products to restaurants and cafes. It has annual revenues of four million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
